cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or its results, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Agricultural Frontier Expansion and Local Development: Evidence from Matopiba, Brazil"
abstract: >-
  Data pipeline and replication code for a study of how agricultural frontier expansion in
  Matopiba (Maranhão, Tocantins, Piauí and Bahia, Brazil) affected local income, employment,
  health, education and urbanization between 1985 and 2025, using Cerrado municipalities
  outside Matopiba as controls. Combines MapBiomas land use, night-time lights, Google Open
  Buildings, IBGE and administrative records, and estimates staggered difference-in-differences
  (Callaway and Sant'Anna), HonestDiD sensitivity analysis and shift-share instruments.
authors:
